# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 16:9
A serene side-by-side still life contrasting two tea brewing styles: on the left, a small porcelain gaiwan with steam rising beside three tiny tasting cups arranged on a wooden tea tray; on the right, a single large Western teapot with one full mug. Soft ink gradients, generous negative space, muted earth tones with a subtle wash of jade green. No text, no characters, no people.
